WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.610
Relax, working with PDFs just got easier.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:10.180
With Chill PDF you can edit your PDFs as many times as you need, hassle-free.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:15.310
Drag and drop your document, or pick it from your files.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.130
Once it's loaded, all the tools are at hand.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:21.940
Delete the pages you don't need,

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:25.580
and if you made a mistake, undo the change.

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:30.950
Reorder pages by dragging them to the position you want.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.170
Add more PDFs to merge them,

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:38.230
from the sidebar or the toolbar.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:43.360
Pick the file, and done: it's added after the last page.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.030
Insert text wherever you need it,

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:49.780
click the page at the spot you want.

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:54.620
Type your text and format it with its own toolbar.

00:00:54.970 --> 00:01:00.170
You can insert images too. Drag the corners to resize,

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.110
and to crop it, click Crop.

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:09.760
Choose the area to keep and apply. Or cancel to leave the image as it was.

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:12.620
And when it's ready, download it.

00:01:13.317 --> 00:01:14.417
Chill PDF
